  "gaps": [
    "The 15-hour concentration block depends on the student's choice of concentration (General: select 5 listed courses; Entrepreneurship: ENTR150, ENTR200, ENTR312, ENTR315, ENTR340; Maritime Law Enforcement: EDMG240, HLSS311, HLSS312, INTL451, LSTD401; Organizational Law Enforcement Leadership: FINC300, HRMT407, HRMT411, MGMT312, MGMT313); the chosen concentration is needed to itemize it.",
