    "The capture does not state transfer-credit limits or upper-division credit minimums.",
    "CMRJ499 requires senior standing and completion of all major courses, and must be the last course before graduation; the capture does not say whether it must be completed at the university.",
    "Literature courses in the Arts & Humanities block require ENGL101 or ENGL110 first (footnote 1)."
